;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b512a60b-a3d6-4f57-a028-52121b761f88\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ac3f4ba7-626a-483f-af37-107cb1e98376\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-08105fb1-88e5-4ca1-ac71-3efc3ebdba60\">해당 현상은 원인이 파악 되었으며, </span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f088194f-5874-4096-a65e-c8d3d5ac9e90\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-36fefcb1-3fc6-42ff-9f1e-589547ff72de\">빠른 시간 내 수정 할 예정입니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7548fe5e-41f9-474d-a593-e50f316c1dcf\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5e218c1a-cdd3-4a88-9dfc-bf680b24d452\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7653fdef-2572-481d-98a4-57cdfc1373ae\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3591aaa1-50be-4462-a02d-4ba84d7ba2bc\">이후의 처리 내용에 대해서는 </span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d21d98eb-442c-4622-aeca-e6b18c39b160\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c5324eba-4073-4b3c-a522-2ab54246a2e0\">별도의 공지사항을 통해 다시 안내해 드리겠습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-540708aa-b306-4dd0-9024-5475c1ae00c4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-07602348-3813-4613-89d1-b0328f81e5b4\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" i